# ✅ Master Audit Checklist

## Pre-Audit Setup

- [ ] Define scope (contracts, chains, integrations)
- [ ] Get documentation (specs, diagrams, previous audits)
- [ ] Set up development environment
- [ ] Run automated tools (Slither, Aderyn, etc.)
- [ ] Document initial findings

---

## 1. Access Control

- [ ] All state-changing functions have appropriate modifiers
- [ ] `onlyOwner` / role checks implemented correctly
- [ ] No `tx.origin` for authentication
- [ ] Modifier logic properly reverts on failure
- [ ] Two-step ownership transfer (Ownable2Step)
- [ ] Critical functions behind timelock
- [ ] Privileged addresses are multisig/timelock, not EOA

---

## 2. Input Validation

- [ ] All external/public function inputs validated
- [ ] Array length checks to prevent DoS
- [ ] Zero address checks where needed
- [ ] Bounds checking on numeric inputs
- [ ] Signature validation complete (no replay)

---

## 3. Reentrancy

- [ ] CEI pattern followed (Checks-Effects-Interactions)
- [ ] ReentrancyGuard on vulnerable functions
- [ ] No state reads after external calls
- [ ] ERC777/ERC721/ERC1155 callbacks considered
- [ ] Read-only reentrancy addressed

---

## 4. Arithmetic

- [ ] No unchecked overflow/underflow in critical paths
- [ ] Division after multiplication for precision
- [ ] Rounding direction favors protocol
- [ ] Safe casting (SafeCast) used
- [ ] Division by zero protected
- [ ] Decimal handling correct across tokens

---

## 5. Oracle Security

- [ ] Uses manipulation-resistant oracle (Chainlink, TWAP)
- [ ] Stale price checks implemented
- [ ] Price bounds validated
- [ ] Fallback oracle available
- [ ] Decimal normalization correct
- [ ] L2 sequencer uptime checked

---

## 6. Token Handling

- [ ] Return values checked (SafeERC20)
- [ ] Fee-on-transfer tokens handled
- [ ] Rebasing tokens considered
- [ ] ERC777 callbacks safe
- [ ] Low decimal tokens work
- [ ] Approval race condition handled
- [ ] Blacklist tokens considered (USDC/USDT)

---

## 7. External Interactions

- [ ] Return values from external calls checked
- [ ] Low-level calls (.call) properly handled
- [ ] Delegatecall targets validated
- [ ] External contract addresses validated
- [ ] Callbacks don't create vulnerabilities

---

## 8. Flash Loan Resistance

- [ ] Governance uses snapshot voting
- [ ] No same-block manipulation possible
- [ ] Time-weighted mechanisms where applicable
- [ ] First depositor attack mitigated
- [ ] Share price manipulation prevented

---

## 9. DeFi-Specific

### Lending
- [ ] Interest accrual before state change
- [ ] Liquidation thresholds appropriate
- [ ] Bad debt handling implemented
- [ ] Collateral factor changes safe

### DEX/AMM
- [ ] Slippage protection required
- [ ] Deadline parameter checked
- [ ] K invariant maintained
- [ ] LP token pricing safe

### Staking
- [ ] Reward calculation correct
- [ ] Cooldown periods enforced
- [ ] No reward manipulation

---

## 10. Upgradability

- [ ] Storage layout compatible between versions
- [ ] Initializer protected (initializer modifier)
- [ ] No selfdestruct in implementation
- [ ] Upgrade function secured
- [ ] Storage gaps for future variables

---

## 11. Gas & DoS

- [ ] No unbounded loops
- [ ] Pull over push for payments
- [ ] Gas limits on external calls considered
- [ ] No block gas limit issues
- [ ] Fallback/receive functions safe

---

## 12. Error Handling

- [ ] Custom errors used (gas efficient)
- [ ] All require statements have messages
- [ ] Try/catch for external calls where needed
- [ ] Failures handled gracefully

---

## 13. Events & Logging

- [ ] State changes emit events
- [ ] Indexed parameters appropriate
- [ ] Events for all critical operations
- [ ] No sensitive data in events

---

## 14. Code Quality

- [ ] No unused variables or imports
- [ ] Comments match implementation
- [ ] NatSpec documentation complete
- [ ] Consistent naming conventions
- [ ] No shadowed variables
- [ ] Visibility explicitly declared

---

## 15. Integration & Composability

- [ ] Works with expected external protocols
- [ ] Handles unexpected return data
- [ ] No assumptions about external state
- [ ] Cross-chain interactions safe

---

## Post-Audit

- [ ] All findings documented
- [ ] PoC created for critical/high
- [ ] Recommendations provided
- [ ] Severity ratings justified
- [ ] Re-review fixed issues
</Parameter>
